# --- Privacy safety net: this repo is public, projects are private -------------------
# Project content (briefs, layouts, shot lists, greyboxes, generated media) lives in
# $AP_ROOT/projects/<slug>/ (its own private git repo), never here. The pre-commit hook in
# scripts/git-hooks/ also refuses project slugs and private terms in staged changes.
projects/
*brief*.md
*brief*.txt
layout.json
shots.json
greybox.json
review.json
runs.jsonl
project.json
site/
shots/
frames/
moodboard/
